workspace root (ci-selection.txt, ci-candidate-commit.txt, ci-failure-summary.txt,
ci-regression-summary.txt, ...). `update` needs GITHUB_TOKEN in the environment
and updates the Check owned by this queue item. If Checks cannot be delivered,
the previous comment for the same context is updated in place, with overflow
pages for large reports. `publish` explicitly selects that comment transport.

